  namespace — where the login form can't read it before login, defeating the whole pre-fill feature. And
  [38;5;153mcreatePreferences()[39m was specified with no parameters while the test plan assumed an injectable adapter; the signature
  now takes an optional [38;5;153m{ adapter }[39m.

